<title>USA: Fine Host Corp Q1 shr $0.11 vs $0.07.</title>
<headline>Fine Host Corp Q1 shr $0.11 vs $0.07.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.11     loss	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net profit		   848     loss	   781</p>
<p> Revs			49,452		   24,160</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 7,951		    3,510</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Quarters ended March 26, 1997 and March 27, 1996.</p>
<p>Results for the 1996 quarter include a charge of $1,040,000, or $0.29 a share for the accretion to redemption of warrants.  Without this charge earnings in the quarter would have been $0.07 a share.</p>
